  "description": "Simple shredy Hard Tail with all the feels. Bouncy bikes are great but nothing beats a hardtail when it comes to trail feel and connection to the dirt. Tucked rear tire, slack front end. long reach. Set up with a 140mm front fork and optimized for 29” x 2.4 - 2.6 wheel size. The hound Climbs like a beast, descends like a bear and is light weight and flickable. Enduro styling with two two sets of bottle bosses as mounting points for gear or H2o. Throw a frame bag in the triangle and take it on an overnight! UDH dropouts, Optional Rhino liner.",
